WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:01.380
After 1945,

2
00:00:01.380 --> 00:00:04.303
regions started building their own

3
00:00:04.303 --> 00:00:07.014
institutions. Some went much further

4
00:00:07.014 --> 00:00:08.268
than others.

5
00:00:08.600 --> 00:00:11.705
ASEAN was founded in Bangkok

6
00:00:11.705 --> 00:00:12.753
in 1967.

7
00:00:12.753 --> 00:00:16.120
SAARC in Dhaka in 1985.

8
00:00:16.120 --> 00:00:17.880
The Maastricht Treaty,

9
00:00:17.880 --> 00:00:19.166
signed in 1992,

10
00:00:19.166 --> 00:00:21.693
created the European Union.

11
00:00:22.028 --> 00:00:23.341
The EU has a single

12
00:00:23.341 --> 00:00:25.324
market, and a common currency

13
00:00:25.324 --> 00:00:26.563
for many members.

14
00:00:26.563 --> 00:00:28.830
ASEAN works by consensus.

15
00:00:28.830 --> 00:00:30.556
SAARC has been held back

16
00:00:30.556 --> 00:00:32.834
by India–Pakistan tensions.

17
00:00:33.182 --> 00:00:35.522
India has leaned on BIMSTEC

18
00:00:35.522 --> 00:00:37.067
as a way around SAARC's

19
00:00:37.067 --> 00:00:38.196
deadlock.

20
00:00:38.892 --> 00:00:40.163
Your turn.

21
00:00:40.163 --> 00:00:42.443
When was ASEAN founded?
